要汽车公司的前董事长威尔逊当国防部部长的时候，他甚至大言不惭地说：“只要对通用汽车公司有好处就是对美国有好处。”他还应该再补上一句话：这对埃克森、德士古和石油老板们也有好处。石油变成了推动经济发展的最重要商品。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 48, "chapterName": "美国的战后石油霸权", "chapterIdx": 48, "reviewId": "17408780_880p9HmYh", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774916808, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142059", "format": "epub", "version": 271346534, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/31/cpplatform_uvinqbp9mmyxbv22au5set/s_cpplatform_uvinqbp9mmyxbv22au5set1745312014.jpg", "title": "石油战争：石油政治决定世界新秩序（增订版）", "author": "[美]威廉·恩道尔", "translator": "赵刚 旷野 戴健", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "美国的战后石油霸权", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 2}}